# Environment variables for the portfolio.
#
# This file documents names and formats only. Never commit real values.
# Production secrets live in Cloudflare Worker settings; CI values live in
# GitHub Actions secrets. Local values belong in .dev.vars, which is git-ignored.

# Public base URL. Used for canonical links, Open Graph, sitemap, robots and
# the build-time content fetch. The production value is https://rishavprasad.in.
SITE_URL=https://rishavprasad.in

# Worker variable declared in wrangler.jsonc (not a secret).
GITHUB_REPO=Rishav0523/rishav-portfolio

# Optional: override the public Turnstile site key baked into the build.
# The default is in lib/site.ts; the site key is public by design.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=

# --- Local development only (.dev.vars) -------------------------------------
# Set these in .dev.vars for `npx wrangler dev`; never in this file.

# Output of: node scripts/hash-password.mjs "<password>"
# Must start with pbkdf2_sha256$100000$ — higher counts fail on Workers.
# ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH=

# 32 random bytes, base64url encoded.
# SESSION_SECRET=

# Turnstile secret key (Cloudflare dashboard, not the public site key).
# TURNSTILE_SECRET=

# Fine-grained GitHub token: Contents read and write on GITHUB_REPO.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Optional R2 media uploads. Uncomment the MEDIA binding in wrangler.jsonc first.
# MEDIA=
